               <title>
                  <content styleCode="italics">Inactive Ingredients</content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>CALCIUM SODIUM BOROSILICATE, SILICA, VINYL DIMETHICONE/METHICONE SILSESQUIOXANE CROSSPOLYMER, LAUROYL LYSINE, TRIETHOXYCAPRYLYLSILANE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POLYHYDROXYSTEARIC ACID, LECITHIN, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, ISOPROPYL MYRISTATE, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, ISOSTEARIC ACID, POLYGLYCERYL-3 POLYRICINOLEATE, IRON OXIDES (CI 77492), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), IRON OXIDES (CI 77499), YELLOW 6 LAKE (CI 15985).</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260107"/>
            </section>
